{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"lines\":[{\"sec\":\"S01\",\"idx\":1,\"text\":\"他只敢露出一点喜欢，还不敢坦白，怕对方为难。\",\"keys\":[\"一点喜欢\",\"不敢坦白\"]},{\"sec\":\"S02\",\"idx\":2,\"text\":\"他怕太急，两人就会不自在，没分开就舍不得。\",\"keys\":[\"太急\",\"不自在\"]},{\"sec\":\"S04\",\"idx\":0,\"text\":\"两人又亲近起来，他想起上次没说出口的话。\",\"keys\":[\"亲近起来\"]},{\"sec\":\"S04\",\"idx\":1,\"text\":\"他想说出心意，也盼对方喜欢他坦白时的样子。\",\"keys\":[\"说出心意\",\"坦白时\"]},{\"sec\":\"S04\",\"idx\":2,\"text\":\"说得太多会让对方为难，两人也不再自在。\",\"keys\":[\"对方为难\",\"不再自在\"]},{\"sec\":\"S05\",\"idx\":1,\"text\":\"对方看出他在乎，他心里却空落落，怕太黏。\",\"keys\":[\"看出他在乎\",\"空落落\"]},{\"sec\":\"S06\",\"idx\":1,\"text\":\"安静下来，他才发现对方不知道他有多害怕。\",\"keys\":[\"他有多害怕\"]},{\"sec\":\"S07\",\"idx\":0,\"text\":\"他渐渐觉得，对方或许也需要他陪着。\",\"keys\":[\"需要他陪着\"]},{\"sec\":\"S07\",\"idx\":1,\"text\":\"他越想越高兴，也越舍不得抽身。\",\"keys\":[\"越想越高兴\"]},{\"sec\":\"S08\",\"idx\":1,\"text\":\"他盼两人一直这样好，却怕明天就变了。\",\"keys\":[\"一直这样好\",\"明天就变了\"]},{\"sec\":\"S09\",\"idx\":0,\"text\":\"他忽然怕有一天，对方不再需要他陪伴。\",\"keys\":[\"不再需要他\"]},{\"sec\":\"S09\",\"idx\":1,\"text\":\"他一下安静了，不敢再往后想。\",\"keys\":[\"一下安静了\"]},{\"sec\":\"S09\",\"idx\":2,\"text\":\"可眼下对方还愿意和他相处，他心里又暖了些。\",\"keys\":[\"愿意和他相处\",\"又暖了些\"]},{\"sec\":\"S10\",\"idx\":0,\"text\":\"他不再猜往后怎样，决定先享受这段时光。\",\"keys\":[\"享受这段时光\"]},{\"sec\":\"S10\",\"idx\":1,\"text\":\"他慢慢放松，心里亮堂得想笑，也有点想哭。\",\"keys\":[\"慢慢放松\",\"想笑\"]},{\"sec\":\"S11\",\"idx\":2,\"text\":\"对方以后愿不愿亲近他，他管不了，心又疼了。\",\"keys\":[\"愿不愿亲近他\"]},{\"sec\":\"S12\",\"idx\":0,\"text\":\"他只想把能给的给对方，不去想会不会回应。\",\"keys\":[\"能给的\",\"不去想会不会回应\"]},{\"sec\":\"S12\",\"idx\":2,\"text\":\"那股高兴终于涌出来，他不再强迫自己收着。\",\"keys\":[\"那股高兴\",\"涌出来\"]},{\"sec\":\"S13\",\"idx\":0,\"text\":\"高兴过后，他更想听对方保证心意不会变。\",\"keys\":[\"更想听\",\"心意不会变\"]},{\"sec\":\"S13\",\"idx\":1,\"text\":\"他怕哪天对方不再需要他，连亲近也没了。\",\"keys\":[\"不再需要他\",\"亲近也没了\"]},{\"sec\":\"S13\",\"idx\":2,\"text\":\"他已没法装作不在乎，再把喜欢藏回去更难受。\",\"keys\":[\"装作不在乎\",\"喜欢藏回去\"]},{\"sec\":\"S14\",\"idx\":2,\"text\":\"既然喜欢已被看见，他就不再藏，往后的事再说。\",\"keys\":[\"喜欢已被看见\",\"不再藏\"]}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c327b6d5-e825-42c8-93e0-3060f7b8b833", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T134544024328Z", "elapsed_seconds": 421.312, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T13:52:45.339376+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5094dbafa929b900880c40cdf524ac683aab8c2cf830c134ffc3c2f7ac862d11", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T134544024328Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "3b63323111cd8f2d46da2c196a97b5422a765623760c6defdf5579f378fea24c"}}}
